# Lantern Hollow

Two brothers learning Godot 4.7 GDScript. Ship a small vertical slice, not a large game.

- Project root is this folder (`project.godot`).
- Work one milestone from `docs/PLAN.md`. Do not build the whole game.
- Teach as you go. Prefer the editor for scenes/tiles/collision/UI; GDScript for rules over time.
- Typed GDScript, tabs, colocated `.tscn` + `.gd`.
- Keep `docs/SESSION_LOG.md` current when a sitting finishes work.
- Ask only when a choice blocks play or changes the design (e.g. lantern fuel vs toggle at Milestone 4).
